        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back",
            "content_html": "<p>暮日悬徊  游影忘归</p>\n<p>她轻轻掸平衣角</p>\n<p>抖落一地余晖</p>\n<hr>\n<p>流云沦醉  林涛荡辉</p>\n<p>远山朦影</p>\n<p>烟晓何处啼惊帷</p>\n<hr>\n<p>风聆吟敲推</p>\n<p>捎带着玄叶  跟随</p>\n<p>青帘掩映着</p>\n<p>透过依稀  重影微</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Later back",
            "title": "晚归",
            "date_modified": "2025-11-29T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-11-29T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep",
            "content_html": "<p>灯忽骤着在变换</p>\n<p>时间也在其间横穿</p>\n<p>月亮的影子游曳在墙上</p>\n<p>星星也就着浮云作伴</p>\n<hr>\n<p>半个爬上窗台的月光</p>\n<p>好奇地摆弄着桌上的玻璃盏</p>\n<p>树梢间也摇来晓风弯弯</p>\n<p>猫儿伸了伸身子</p>\n<p>眼睛绕着月亮</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Bad sleep",
            "title": "失眠",
            "date_modified": "2025-10-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-10-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window",
            "content_html": "<p>暮光游过我的窗棂</p>\n<p>悄然带来深空的回音</p>\n<p>是夜无声寂静</p>\n<p>只有风还在我的耳边轻声低鸣</p>\n<p>那游离零乱的星星</p>\n<p>是否已带走了你的只单形影</p>\n<p>是否我们已在共赏今夜月明</p>\n<p>云拂月畔  你是否也在等待我的聆听？</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The window",
            "title": "窗棂",
            "date_modified": "2025-09-13T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-09-13T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/Template",
            "content_html": "<h2>引子:</h2>\n<p>在<u>完成博客网站的搭建和部署</u>之后,当然是在里面<strong>发布文章</strong>啦,那么在Valaxy里面有什么文章配置设置吗?答案是有的.当然,在使用时,我们要万分注意一些使用要点,不然</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/Template\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/Template</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/Template",
            "title": "关于博客文章里的一部分常用配置",
