        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Reminding deeply",
            "content_html": "<p>你在沉思</p>\n<p>你的思想</p>\n<p>也在时间的洪流中</p>\n<p>停滞</p>\n<hr>\n<p>你在细数流逝</p>\n<p>是谁离去</p>\n<p>谁又开始</p>\n<hr>\n<p>你在思想中度日</p>\n<p>春来秋至</p>\n<p>茶饭不</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Reminding deeply\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Reminding deeply</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Reminding deeply",
            "title": "迷思",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-16T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-06-16T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/blog-creat",
            "content_html": "<h2>引子:</h2>\n<p>有些人可能会很好奇，站长站长，请问这个站点是你怎样搭建起来的呀？” 那么这篇文章对你可就大有帮助了，不用担心你会不会听懂，这你就尽管放心。 这篇文章主要是面向小白的（真的，零编程基</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/blog-creat\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/blog-creat</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/blog/blog-creat",
            "title": "关于个人搭建静态博客站点的经验与各种坑 （Valaxy篇）",
            "date_modified": "2025-06-15T14:35:43.000Z",
