        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother",
            "content_html": "<p>扬起一片孤帆</p>\n<p>让未来与波涛轮转</p>\n<p>海风微微流散</p>\n<p>海面与澄蓝</p>\n<p>也轻轻一起把手挽</p>\n<hr>\n<p>孤帆行船日月流转</p>\n<p>多么空阔这星汉灿烂</p>\n<p>多么清爽这海风舒软</p>\n<p>船已不知何时离岸</p>\n<p>心却扯着海岸线</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/For mother",
            "title": "海岸",
            "date_modified": "2025-05-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-05-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework",
            "content_html": "<p>小窗  灯黄</p>\n<p>一抹新月抚过山岗</p>\n<p>静树无言  云疏晚妆</p>\n<p>纤纤风中流云飘荡</p>\n<hr>\n<p>天野苍苍  风径茫茫</p>\n<p>璨然烟火</p>\n<p>也燃不尽寥寥两行</p>\n<p>漫天倾乱如霜降</p>\n<p>眼见的却只</p>\n<p>散落一地余光</p>\n<p>--</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Time above the firework",
            "title": "烟火上的时光",
            "date_modified": "2025-05-06T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-05-06T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time",
            "content_html": "<p>悠悠云啾啾</p>\n<p>水波空望丘</p>\n<p>淡卷风追云吹去</p>\n<p>翠坠光垂水轻酬</p>\n<hr>\n<p>依依  是薄云依旧</p>\n<p>青青  是翠衫满楼</p>\n<p>晓风呼骤</p>\n<p>云掩帘头</p>\n<hr>\n<p>悠扬的云廊之上</p>\n<p>几里点淡蓝的洋流</p>\n<p>随时光游</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Cloud boat by the  time",
            "title": "云舟",
            "date_modified": "2025-04-28T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-04-28T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by",
            "content_html": "<p>逝去的总是很多很多</p>\n<p>瀚瀚如车流穿过</p>\n<p>留下杳杳无若</p>\n<p>微忆星火</p>\n<hr>\n<p>时弦轻着</p>\n<p>微叹境迁时过</p>\n<p>隐隐不见余光吹落</p>\n<p>无心地扔掉很多很多</p>\n<hr>\n<p>走在漫漫长路上</p>\n<p>所见皆往匆匆流过</p>\n<p>无</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Passed by",
            "title": "错过",
            "date_modified": "2025-04-17T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-04-17T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within",
            "content_html": "<p>青青山色雾轻拢</p>\n<p>悠悠彩云影相重</p>\n<hr>\n<p>好渴望这样的世界啊</p>\n<p>没有忙忙匆匆</p>\n<p>心事重重</p>\n<p>旧事种种</p>\n<hr>\n<p>往事都像游絮一样</p>\n<p>离散在空中</p>\n<p>微风的指尖</p>\n<p>稍带点初春的懵懂</p>\n<hr>\n<p>飞</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Within",
            "title": "之中",
            "date_modified": "2025-04-17T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-04-17T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery",
            "content_html": "<p>淡彩苍织</p>\n<p>霓虹空蚀</p>\n<p>一丛一丛的错枝</p>\n<p>一叶一叶的舟矢</p>\n<p>都在相互望着无时</p>\n<hr>\n<p>地上—</p>\n<p>风弦无心拨栀</p>\n<p>彩绸挂满虬枝</p>\n<p>淡且盛且鲜妍</p>\n<p>浓且羞且微显</p>\n<p>馨香散湿</p>\n<p>流风遍执</p>\n<hr>\n<p>天</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The weaving of spring scenery",
            "title": "春朝织",
            "date_modified": "2025-04-03T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-04-03T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time",
            "content_html": "<p>风儿轻轻摇曳</p>\n<p>惊蝉落叶流泻</p>\n<p>携来远方  携来花叶</p>\n<p>带着远方的思绪</p>\n<p>在这里书写</p>\n<hr>\n<p>晓看浮云飘别</p>\n<p>送走雨丝棉叶</p>\n<p>灯也倾斜  雨也微斜</p>\n<p>只在此</p>\n<p>匆匆留下</p>\n<p>未写完的诗篇</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Rush time",
            "title": "匆匆",
            "date_modified": "2025-03-16T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-03-16T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time",
            "content_html": "<p>晓风  流荧  云纱</p>\n<p>幽芳  青竹  飞花</p>\n<p>眼望这满世界的过客啊</p>\n<p>无人停下</p>\n<hr>\n<p>春发  蝉夏</p>\n<p>秋月  冬花</p>\n<p>记住了什么</p>\n<p>却总也不知该如何回答</p>\n<hr>\n<p>星海漫卷</p>\n<p>日月更行</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/The sand by the sea of time",
            "title": "飞沙",
            "date_modified": "2025-03-02T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-03-02T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind",
            "content_html": "<p>你像波浪一样</p>\n<p>轻轻飘来</p>\n<p>挑逗枝丫间的绿漾</p>\n<p>悄悄摘下几片花瓣</p>\n<p>在平广的旷野上</p>\n<p>带走三分</p>\n<p>淡淡的清香</p>\n<hr>\n<p>越过浓郁的青山</p>\n<p>是雪白的故乡</p>\n<p>偶尔从不知名的远方</p>\n<p>传来你的回响</p>\n<p>我的</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Wind",
            "title": "风",
            "date_modified": "2025-02-10T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-02-10T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
