        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring",
            "content_html": "<p>纤小的枝条</p>\n<p>被风轻轻抚起</p>\n<p>空中游离的白絮</p>\n<p>对上一场清雪</p>\n<p>也似乎仍未忘记</p>\n<p>青鸟衔来几枝嫩叶</p>\n<p>碧蓝的静谧</p>\n<p>对着纷杂的低空涮洗</p>\n<p>偶尔空中捎来</p>\n<p>几瓣轻轻的彩衣</p>\n<p>在里面承载着</p>\n<p>对一整个春天</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Spring",
            "title": "春",
            "date_modified": "2025-01-18T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-01-18T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer",
            "content_html": "<p>以深遂为背景</p>\n<p>以繁星为指针</p>\n<p>以寰字为中心</p>\n<p>以流年为齿轮</p>\n<hr>\n<p>有繁硕的倾盆</p>\n<p>也有燃烬</p>\n<p>所滑过的余温</p>\n<hr>\n<p>是月明时的陌生人</p>\n<p>也是昏暝时的引路人</p>\n<p>是随处隐逸的无声</p>\n<p>却也是</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Starlight flowing pointer",
            "title": "星钟",
            "date_modified": "2024-12-27T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-12-27T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing",
            "content_html": "<p>星光在昼夜中更替</p>\n<p>霓霞在交光中掀起</p>\n<p>我们却</p>\n<p>总是在落叶后追忆</p>\n<p>面对着黄花满地</p>\n<p>不住地叹息</p>\n<hr>\n<p>叹息又有什么用呢？</p>\n<p>或许</p>\n<p>他都不能保留</p>\n<p>你来过的痕迹</p>\n<p>却会在你心中</p>\n<p>留下重重</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Foiling and wishing",
            "title": "秋风与星星",
            "date_modified": "2024-12-12T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-12-12T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering",
            "content_html": "<p>不知从何时起</p>\n<p>记忆便在脑海中</p>\n<p>不断清洗</p>\n<p>洗去了一天又一天</p>\n<p>一季  又一季</p>\n<p>究竟洗去了什么</p>\n<p>也不知从何问起</p>\n<hr>\n<p>定义的清晰</p>\n<p>也只是暂存的余迹</p>\n<p>残存的心系</p>\n<p>也不过未经的此彼</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Remembering",
            "title": "记",
            "date_modified": "2024-11-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-11-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds",
            "content_html": "<p>夜  落幕</p>\n<p>云  迁逐</p>\n<hr>\n<p>一片若有若无的</p>\n<p>色晕</p>\n<p>伴着流云</p>\n<p>寻逐</p>\n<hr>\n<p>薄薄云雾</p>\n<p>流露  不复</p>\n<p>漫漫时途</p>\n<p>不住  踌躇</p>\n<hr>\n<p>或许</p>\n<p>碰上个云团</p>\n<p>也是个未知数</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Alone the clouds",
            "title": "云睹",
            "date_modified": "2024-10-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-10-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds",
            "content_html": "<p>淡淡的颜色</p>\n<p>悠悠地流着</p>\n<p>天河</p>\n<hr>\n<p>千变的莫测</p>\n<p>慢慢地变着</p>\n<p>风车</p>\n<p>微微轻风</p>\n<p>朗朗晴空</p>\n<p>都在飘泊着</p>\n<p>过客</p>\n<hr>\n<p>绿叶摇曳着</p>\n<p>落下</p>\n<p>粉荷</p>\n<p>在风中飞舞着</p>\n<hr>\n<p>只是在</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lovely clouds",
            "title": "云",
            "date_modified": "2024-10-12T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-10-12T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village",
            "content_html": "<p>小小的山村</p>\n<p>坐在重叠的山郭</p>\n<p>清清的流水</p>\n<p>躺在错杂的村落</p>\n<p>疲阳沉落</p>\n<hr>\n<p>淡淡的云朵</p>\n<p>飘过几家淡淡的烟火</p>\n<p>淡淡的归途</p>\n<p>传过几声淡淡的牛哞</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Leisurely village",
            "title": "小村",
            "date_modified": "2024-09-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-09-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town",
            "content_html": "<p>故乡  在哪里</p>\n<p>故乡有碧绿的长廊</p>\n<p>翠竹挺挺</p>\n<p>古松苍苍</p>\n<hr>\n<p>故乡会清脆地歌唱</p>\n<p>泉声潺潺</p>\n<p>暮鼓悠长</p>\n<hr>\n<p>故乡是一颗种子</p>\n<p>故乡有泥土的芬芳</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Home town",
            "title": "故乡",
            "date_modified": "2024-09-03T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-09-03T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying",
            "content_html": "<p>树叶沙沙响</p>\n<p>那是风走过的地方</p>\n<p>蝴蝶翩翩翔</p>\n<p>那是花开遍的地方</p>\n<hr>\n<p>世界很大很大</p>\n<p>大到看不到头</p>\n<p>山高水长</p>\n<p>世界很小很小</p>\n<p>小到不过几人</p>\n<p>便无物可装</p>\n<hr>\n<p>炊烟静静长</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Places of love staying",
            "title": "停留的地方",
            "date_modified": "2024-08-21T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-08-21T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always",
            "content_html": "<p>家是温暖的避风港</p>\n<p>里面的灯火</p>\n<p>从不打烊</p>\n<hr>\n<p>在里面的</p>\n<p>有亲爱的母亲啊</p>\n<p>母亲的心</p>\n<p>像天一样宽广</p>\n<p>广到</p>\n<p>我们飞也飞不出</p>\n<p>看也看不到尽头</p>\n<p>母亲的事</p>\n<p>像针线一样细长</p>\n<p>长到</p>\n<p>像</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Mother`s love always",
            "title": "避风港的灯火",
            "date_modified": "2024-08-14T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-08-14T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Pond",
            "content_html": "<p>家是一处山间的小水塘</p>\n<p>温馨  没有风浪</p>\n<p>我们是里面的鱼儿</p>\n<p>微小  在里面徜徉</p>\n<hr>\n<p>大一点了</p>\n<p>水塘就显得小了</p>\n<p>鱼儿纷纷跳进大江</p>\n<p>闻到了牡丹花的芬芳</p>\n<p>听到了画眉鸟的歌唱</p>\n<hr>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Pond\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Pond</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Pond",
            "title": "水塘",
            "date_modified": "2024-08-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-08-11T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time",
            "content_html": "<p>当我们不再  热爱</p>\n<p>生活</p>\n<p>便显得无力苍白</p>\n<p>风景也不再精彩</p>\n<hr>\n<p>当我们不再  释怀</p>\n<p>就不会想起</p>\n<p>往事不再</p>\n<p>过去</p>\n<p>已无法更改</p>\n<hr>\n<p>当你不在</p>\n<p>我便不知</p>\n<p>这里是该来</p>\n<p>还是</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Not that time",
            "title": "不再",
            "date_modified": "2024-06-23T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-06-23T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lost",
            "content_html": "<p>不是所有的东西</p>\n<p>失去了  还会拥有</p>\n<p>就像青春</p>\n<p>走过了  就只能回首</p>\n<hr>\n<p>并不是所有的路</p>\n<p>走过了  还能回头</p>\n<p>就像江河</p>\n<p>游过了  就不再回流</p>\n<hr>\n<p>为什么</p>\n<p>我们总是这样</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lost\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lost</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Lost",
            "title": "丢",
            "date_modified": "2024-06-15T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-06-15T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought",
            "content_html": "<p>天边浮云轻轻</p>\n<p>小径气息清新</p>\n<p>沉睡的小径</p>\n<p>又开遍了蒲公英</p>\n<hr>\n<p>你说过</p>\n<p>当这条小径</p>\n<p>开满蒲公英</p>\n<p>除了风景</p>\n<p>还会有你</p>\n<hr>\n<p>路好静好静</p>\n<p>静静带走了心灵</p>\n<p>风好轻好轻</p>\n<p>轻轻托</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Batter/Memories and thought",
            "title": "小径和蒲公英",
            "date_modified": "2024-06-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-06-07T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds",
            "content_html": "<p>校园的花</p>\n<p>又亭亭挂上了树枝</p>\n<p>转眼间</p>\n<p>三年也将流逝</p>\n<p>手握的一支一支</p>\n<p>笔下的一纸一纸</p>\n<p>也试图</p>\n<p>将流逝延迟</p>\n<hr>\n<p>可我只见</p>\n<p>记忆被时间打碎</p>\n<p>被流水侵蚀</p>\n<p>只剩碎片为止</p>\n<p>我想奋力捡</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Fading clouds",
            "title": "云彩流逝",
            "date_modified": "2024-05-29T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-05-29T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting",
            "content_html": "<p>微雨轻轻</p>\n<p>窗外白羽稀稀</p>\n<p>路旁的树儿</p>\n<p>轻轻接住了这希望</p>\n<p>一滴又一滴</p>\n<hr>\n<p>薄云依依</p>\n<p>天上白纸清清</p>\n<p>窗内的蒲公英</p>\n<p>等待着这风儿</p>\n<p>一季  又一季</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/waiting",
            "title": "等",
            "date_modified": "2024-05-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-05-19T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory",
            "content_html": "<p>回忆像风</p>\n<p>吹过来</p>\n<p>吹过去</p>\n<p>吹动了我的心绪</p>\n<p>却吹不动我</p>\n<p>回忆像水</p>\n<p>流过来</p>\n<p>流过去</p>\n<p>流在我的心间</p>\n<p>我却抓也抓不住</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Memory",
            "title": "回忆",
            "date_modified": "2024-05-06T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-05-06T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star",
            "content_html": "<p>把星星挂在天上</p>\n<p>让迷路的人</p>\n<p>能够找回方向</p>\n<p>把星星贴在墙上</p>\n<p>让可爱的孩子</p>\n<p>安然进入梦乡</p>\n<p>把星星放在心上</p>\n<p>让远行的游子</p>\n<p>总是心存希望</p>\n<p>你像星星一样</p>\n<p>散发着星光</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/star",
            "title": "星星",
            "date_modified": "2024-04-17T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-04-17T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Why",
            "content_html": "<p>你问我为什么</p>\n<p>喜欢星星和月亮</p>\n<p>我想</p>\n<p>深不可测的黑夜里</p>\n<p>它们无疑最闪亮</p>\n<p>会为我指明方向</p>\n<p>你问我为什么</p>\n<p>喜欢浮云和蓝天</p>\n<p>你不见</p>\n<p>一望无际的坦荡里</p>\n<p>它们高过了地平线</p>\n<p>高和远从不受限</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Why\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Why</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Why",
            "title": "为什么",
            "date_modified": "2024-04-08T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-04-08T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance",
            "content_html": "<p>在一片微朦中</p>\n<p>向东</p>\n<p>水光潋滟</p>\n<p>往事随风</p>\n<p>在一阵清爽里</p>\n<p>回忆</p>\n<p>轻言静谧</p>\n<p>虹光四溢</p>\n<p>在清晨看雨</p>\n<p>在夏夜看星</p>\n<p>我在远方</p>\n<p>等待着 曾经的你</p>\n<br/><p>访问 <a href=\"https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance\" target=\"_blank\">https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance</a> 阅读全文。</p>",
            "url": "https://fuyunxinyu.github.io/posts/poem/Distance",
            "title": "远方",
            "date_modified": "2024-04-03T00:00:00.000Z",
            "date_published": "2024-04-03T00:00:00.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "浮芸星语空悠悠",
                "url": "https://valaxy.site"
            }
        }
    ]
}